# 46. PASS Criteria

PASS requires all of the following:

- all upstream sources independently QA-approved;
- no WIP artifact used as authoritative source;
- IDs and coordinate metadata consistent;
- passage preserved exactly;
- assessment preserved exactly;
- scoring semantics preserved;
- Content Job metadata preserved correctly;
- delivery mapping correct;
- runtime schema passes;
- runtime metadata valid;
- learner/internal data correctly separated;
- answer-key separation valid;
- source provenance accurate;
- QA provenance accurate;
- zero WIP dependencies;
- encoding intact;
- data structure valid;
- word-count integrity preserved;
- package versioning valid;
- no stale source artifacts;
- whole-package integration coherent;
- package is staging/deployment ready;
- zero unresolved BLOCKER findings;
- zero unresolved MAJOR findings.

For the current pipeline:

```text
NO CONDITIONAL PASS
```

