# 47. FAIL_REWORK

Use when all defects can be corrected entirely within Stage 05 packaging without modifying approved upstream artifacts.

The package remains in:

```text
D:\Sridhar\Projects\SpeedReader\pipeline\wip
```

Required flow:

```text
Stage 05 QA findings
↓
Stage 05 ChatGPT Work
↓
Packaging corrections
↓
Mechanical self-validation
↓
Semantic/integration self-validation
↓
New WIP package version
↓
Stage 05 QA full independent re-review
```

Nothing is promoted to `approved`.

---

# 48. BLOCKED

Use when resolution requires:

- reopening an upstream stage;
- correcting an approved source artifact;
- resolving a runtime specification conflict;
- obtaining a missing authoritative dependency.

The Stage 05 package remains in WIP.

No deployment/integration may begin.

